{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions","id":1257027,"title":"Heroes Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-24T14:25:40-07:00","id":1257027,"title":"Heroes Questions","content":"So I\u2019m just after reading 3 pages of answer posts from searching \u2018Hero\u2019 in 62 pages long \u2018Ask simple question\u2019 topic \u2013 and still not having answers to problems I found in Heroes mechanics. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( Even when I read interesting ideas on crossovers Heroes with other splats. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) To not lose my sanity in searching in there, I start a shorter topic to answer some more basic questions of Beasts natural antagonists.<br /> <br /> <b>Heroes Questions</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>WHEN Hero-to-be becomes mechanical Hero?</b> On what terms he get\u2019s <i>Hard to Kill</i>, <i>Life &amp; Legend</i> and <i>Heroic Tracking</i>? Ability to place Anathema on Beasts? Call Followers in their dreams? With Heroic Gifts it\u2019s simple matter \u2013 Hero get\u2019s first Gift on his first kill of Beast. But what with other traits? For example, I plan to use newly awoken Hero in my story. He just get weird dreams about Beast that makes disturbance in local Primordial Dream. Would he just after one or two nights of nightmares had those abilities already? Would he simply woke up and had Virtue &amp; Vice replaced with Life &amp; Legend? Got <i>Heroic Tracking</i>? Can he concentrate and simply Call the Followers now? Or do it need to pass some logical number of nights? <b>Or maybe he must do something to activate those powers? OR they simply do not show up until Hero does his first kill?</b></li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-24T14:29:02-07:00","id":1257028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions#post1257027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I\u2019m just after reading 3 pages of answer posts from searching \u2018Hero\u2019 in 62 pages long \u2018Ask simple question\u2019 topic \u2013 and still not having answers to problems I found in Heroes mechanics. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( Even when I read interesting ideas on crossovers Heroes with other splats. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) To not lose my sanity in searching in there, I start a shorter topic to answer some more basic questions of Beasts natural antagonists.<br /> <br /> <b>Heroes Questions</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>WHEN Hero-to-be becomes mechanical Hero?</b> On what terms he get\u2019s <i>Hard to Kill</i>, <i>Life &amp; Legend</i> and <i>Heroic Tracking</i>? Ability to place Anathema on Beasts? Call Followers in their dreams? With Heroic Gifts it\u2019s simple matter \u2013 Hero get\u2019s first Gift on his first kill of Beast. But what with other traits? For example, I plan to use newly awoken Hero in my story. He just get weird dreams about Beast that makes disturbance in local Primordial Dream. Would he just after one or two nights of nightmares had those abilities already? Would he simply woke up and had Virtue &amp; Vice replaced with Life &amp; Legend? Got <i>Heroic Tracking</i>? Can he concentrate and simply Call the Followers now? Or do it need to pass some logical number of nights? <b>Or maybe he must do something to activate those powers? OR they simply do not show up until Hero does his first kill?</b></li> </ol></div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> , this is a good question, but <i>please</i> just ask this question in the 'ask a simple question' thread. Just put it in at the end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,