strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions?p=1257097#post1257097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You want more Heroes related questions \u2013 here I got another one.<br /> <br /> <b>2. How Heroes get into Beasts Lair without <i>Open Gate</i> Gift, to get his first kill?</b> After reading corebook, <b>Beast Player\u2019s Guide</b> and <b>Conquering Heroes</b> section on Heroes \u2013 I cannot see much like Hero can enter Heart of Lair without consent of the Begotten he is stalking.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is an obvious answer to this very simple question and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/873180-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-beast-edition\">there is a clearly-labeled venue for that exchange to take place in</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T00:19:14-07:00","id":1257101,"title":"","content":"Well, the hero could simply recognize the beast in material world and kill her without a word.<br /> One of the heroes in the night horror book does exactly that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T00:20:13-07:00","id":1257102,"title":"","content":"Hamster, more questions does not stop the fact that all of these are simple questions that do not need their own thread. I can answer all of them in a heartbeat and the only reason I refuse to is because <i>this is ridiculous.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T00:33:18-07:00","id":1257106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neos01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions?p=1257101#post1257101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the hero could simply recognize the beast in material world and kill her without a word.<br /> One of the heroes in the night horror book does exactly that</div> </div> </div> </div>It's partially solves a problem with 2 if\u2026<br /> <br /> 3.<b> Can Hero simply SEE into Horror on the Beast, without a Gift? </b><i>Heroic Tracking</i> implies that Heroes only sense Primordial Dream disturbance around the Beast, <i>Heroic Stalking</i> pin-points the Begotten as source of disturbances. But still, it\u2019s not exactly \u2018this granny in front of you is monstrous hag\u2019 revelation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T01:48:14-07:00","id":1257127,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">If you aren't going to answer the questions being asked please don't post replies, just ignore the thread and move along. Thank you.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T02:55:08-07:00","id":1257138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions?p=1257106#post1257106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's partially solves a problem with 2 if\u2026<br /> <br /> 3.<b> Can Hero simply SEE into Horror on the Beast, without a Gift? </b><i>Heroic Tracking</i> implies that Heroes only sense Primordial Dream disturbance around the Beast, <i>Heroic Stalking</i> pin-points the Begotten as source of disturbances. But still, it\u2019s not exactly \u2018this granny in front of you is monstrous hag\u2019 revelation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless you gain an exeptional success.<br /> If not i think that the hero could simply observe the behavior of the nearby people until the beast do something wrong<br /> <br /> Anyway i m with the others, using the ask a simple question thread would be better","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24346,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","user":"Neos01","date":". 09-25-2018, 06:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T07:31:16-07:00","id":1257186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions?p=1257106#post1257106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3.<b> Can Hero simply SEE into Horror on the Beast, without a Gift? </b>(...) <i>Heroic Stalking </i>pin-points the Begotten as source of disturbances. But still, it\u2019s not exactly \u2018this granny in front of you is monstrous hag\u2019 revelation.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neos01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions?p=1257138#post1257138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unless you gain an exeptional success.</div> </div> </div> </div>My <b>BtP</b> corebook seems to disagree on seeing Horror of Begotten on exp. suc. in <i>Heroic Stalking</i>:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>\u2019BtP, p. 207\u2019</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Success:</b> The Hero knows whether or not the Beast is currently present nearby, and whether a Beast has used a supernatural ability nearby within 24 hours.<br /> <br /> <b>Exceptional Success:</b> The Hero also learns exactly how many Beasts are currently present, and <b>can identify them as such on sight. This does not grant any particular ability to see through disguises or to find Beasts who are otherwise hidden. </b></div> </div> </div> </div>Quotes seems to imply that Hero \u2018knows\u2019 that Beast is different from human being \u2013 but still do not see the Horror itself, even on exp. suc, on <i>Heroic Stalking</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It seems to imply rather that Hero on <i>Stalking</i> rather think that Begotten is something like \u2018I <i>know</i> he is the culprit.\u2019 Without self-imposed context of Hero that he looks for \u2018horrific legendary creature\u2019 \u2013 until he sees Beasts Horror, it seems to point that young Hero can only say that Child is maybe a serial killer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If I read this wrong, point me where.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neos01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions?p=1257138#post1257138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If not i think that the hero could simply observe the behavior of the nearby people until the beast do something wrong</div> </div> </div> </div>It still it\u2019s more \u2013 Hero thinking about Beast \u2013 \u2018I know he is culprit of those murders\u2019. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T07:40:52-07:00","id":1257190,"title":"","content":"As connected to seeing Horror of Beasts is question\u2026<br /> <br /> 4.<b> Are Heroes Kin to Beasts? Heroes are treated as Minor Template, in universe, yes? </b>As they both with Begotten are creatures of Primordial Dream. And Kin can see Horror of Child on their Atavisms activations \u2013 and this quotes seems to imply that Heroes can see Beast\u2019s Horror when Atavisms are activated.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>\u2019BtP, p. 122\u2019</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Beings with supernatural senses, however, catch a glimpse of the Horror when the Beast activates an Atavism. This includes any supernatural creature (vampire, werewolf, changeling, Sin-Eater, etc.), <b>normal human beings with the Unseen Sense Merit (no matter what it usually detects), Heroes</b>, ephemeral beings (see p. 182) and anyone else with sensitivity to otherworldly phenomena at the Storyteller\u2019s discretion.<br /> <br /> Glimpsing the Horror in this way doesn\u2019t grant the witness any real understanding of what he is seeing. The witness sees the Eshmaki take a deep breath and then exhale a gout of blue fire, but if he is at all supernaturally aware, he always sees the mighty dragon superimposed over the Beast\u2019s mortal form, unleashing its hellish breath. The Makara activates Monster From the Deep and everyone in the room feels the pressure of the tentacles around their necks, but only the Beast\u2019s Promethean companion actually sees the kraken lurking below.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>So it seems that for Hero to know he hunts real monsters \u2013 not \u2018serial killers\u2019 \u2013 all you need to make is that Hero see Atavisms activated in front of him \u2013 then Beast\u2019s Horror will show over her. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T09:48:55-07:00","id":1257213,"title":"","content":"The hero Candy Rasmussen ( conquering heroes pag 22) shows the ability to see her first beast horror without gift and not while using atavism, i desume she gained the exeptional success effect but i m not sure","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T21:09:21-07:00","id":1257301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neos01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1257027-heroes-questions?p=1257213#post1257213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The hero Candy Rasmussen ( conquering heroes pag 22) shows the ability to see her first beast horror without gift and not while using atavism, i desume she gained the exeptional success effect but i m not sure</div> </div> </div> </div>Devs not reading in detail their own games rules would not be first time in <b>CoD</b> games. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If you got other idea how Hero could see Horror without Atavism activated - I'm all ears.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}